			"notes": "* Replaced the Config menu with a new one\n* Fixed color input\n* _A lot of the code has been refactored_\n* Added a arrows toggle setting\n* Removed _\"Waypoint\"_ from language strings\n* Added a distance setting that displays a waypoint's distance when aiming near it\n* Added a colored arrows setting that colors the waypoint arrows with their respective waypoint pin's color\n* Added a new setting for the Locator Bar background: **CLEVER** - which renders the locator bar when on spectator mode or when the xp bar's progress equals 0.\n* The logger id is now \"xdbar\" and will now be used to display error/warnings\n\n**HAPPY NEW YEAR!**"
